# The docs are no longer pages of this site (they live on as demo content
# in the live editor), but their URLs were indexed. They redirect to the
# landing page rather than falling through to the SPA rule below, which
# would answer them at status 200: a soft 404 that search engines keep in
# the index. First match wins, so these must precede /*.
/docs      /    301
/docs/     /    301
/docs/*    /    301

# SPA fallback. Prerendered routes exist as real static files
# (download.html, docs/index.html for the landing) and Cloudflare Pages
# serves static assets before redirect rules, so this only catches
# non-prerendered paths.
/*    /index.html   200
